  "readme": "<div align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://capsule-render.vercel.app/api?type=rounded&color=gradient&customColorList=6,8,10&height=180&section=header&text=%E2%9C%A6%20Welcome%20to%20Virtual%20Doraemon%20%E2%9C%A6&fontSize=32&fontAlignY=45&fontColor=ffffff&desc=Your%20Nostalgic%20Interactive%2022nd-Century%20Companion&descAlignY=68&descSize=16&descAlign=50\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Virtual Doraemon Header\"/>\r\n<br/>\r\n<img src=\"https://readme-typing-svg.demolab.com?font=Fira+Code&weight=600&size=19&pause=1000&color=48CAE4&center=true&vCenter=true&width=750&lines=%E2%9C%A6+Interactive+CSS+Character+Animations+%E2%9C%A6;%E2%9C%A6+Iconic+Gadget+Pocket+Interactions+%E2%9C%A6;%E2%9C%A6+Responsive+Sound+Effects+%26+Dialogues+%E2%9C%A6;%E2%9C%A6+Pure+Web+Technologies+(No+Frameworks)+%E2%9C%A6\" alt=\"Virtual Doraemon Typing Animated\"/>\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<a href=\"https://vidushisen.github.io/My-Virtual-Doraemon-/\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%E2%96%B6%20LIVE%20DEMO-VISIT%20NOW-00A0E9?style=for-the-badge&logo=googlechrome&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Live Demo\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/vidushisen/My-Virtual-Doraemon-/stargazers\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/vidushisen/My-Virtual-Doraemon-?style=for-the-badge&color=023E8A&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Stars\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/vidushisen/My-Virtual-Doraemon-/network/members\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/forks/vidushisen/My-Virtual-Doraemon-?style=for-the-badge&color=0077B6&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Forks\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/vidushisen/My-Virtual-Doraemon-/blob/main/LICENSE\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-222222?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"License\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr/>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n💙 About The Project 💙\r\n</div>\r\n<br/>\r\n** My Virtual Doraemon ** is a fun, nostalgic, interactive browser companion that brings the legendary robotic cat from the 22nd century directly to your screen!\r\nCrafted with pure HTML, modern CSS styling, and dynamic JavaScript, this project features fluid expressions, playful animations, and delightful gadget interactions designed to bring joy and nostalgia to fans of all ages.\r\n<br/>\r\n<hr/>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n⚡ Key Features ⚡\r\n</div>\r\n<br/>\r\n- 🐱 Interactive Expressions: Click and hover to trigger expressive facial animations and reactions.\r\n- 🪄 4D Magic Pocket: Unbox beloved gadgets like the Anywhere Door, Bamboo Copter, and Dorayaki.\r\n- 🎨 Pure CSS Artwork: Handcrafted character illustrations and smooth keyframe animations.\r\n- 📱 Cross-Device Ready: Perfectly centered and responsive on both mobile and desktop screens.\r\n- 🚀 Zero Dependencies: Pure vanilla web code that loads instantly in any modern browser.\r\n<br/>\r\n<hr/>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n🛠️ Tech Stack 🛠️\r\n</div>\r\n<br/>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/HTML5-E34F26?style=for-the-badge&logo=html5&logoColor=white\" alt=\"HTML5\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CSS3-1572B6?style=for-the-badge&logo=css3&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CSS3\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/JavaScript-F7DF1E?style=for-the-badge&logo=javascript&logoColor=black\" alt=\"JavaScript\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://pages.github.com\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub_Pages-222222?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub Pages\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n</div>\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<hr/>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n🚀 Quick Play (5 Seconds) 🚀\r\n</div>\r\n<br/>\r\n```bash\r\n 1. Clone repository\r\ngit clone https://github.com/vidushisen/My-Virtual-Doraemon-.git\r\n 2. Enter folder\r\ncd My-Virtual-Doraemon-\r\n 3. Open in any browser!\r\n```\r\n<br/>\r\n<hr/>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n⭐ Support & Feedback ⭐\r\n<br/>\r\n<font color=\"#48CAE4\"><b>⭐ If you like this project, please consider giving it a Star! ⭐</b></font>\r\n<br/><br/>\r\nDeveloped with passion by **[Vidushi Sen](https://github.com/vidushisen)**\r\n<br/>\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/vidushisen\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Follow%20on%20GitHub-181717?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub Profile\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<img src=\"https://capsule-render.vercel.app/api?type=waving&color=gradient&customColorList=6,8,10&height=100&section=footer\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Footer\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n",
